    "title": "Tri-State community gathers to support Korean War veteran returned home after 70 years - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By TRUMP ON EPSTEIN ,\n1 days ago BLANCHESTER, Ohio (WKRC) - Army Cpl. Earl Kibbey, who enlisted at 17 and died a few months later during the Korean War, has finally returned home after more than 70 years. Despite the rain, a large crowd gathered to support Kibbey and his family as his remains arrived at CVG and were escorted to Blanchester. The community welcomed them with a hero's reception, with fire trucks forming a ceremonial arch. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
